<title>SWEDEN: Proventus sells 12.5 pct Puma stake to U.S. group.</title>
<headline>Proventus sells 12.5 pct Puma stake to U.S. group.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment group Proventus AB on Wednesday said it had sold half of its stake in Germany's sports equipment group Puma AB Rudolf Dassler Sport to Monarchy/Regency Enterprises of the U.S..</p>
<p>Proventus said in a statement it had sold 12.5 percent of shares in Puma to Hollywood independent film company Monarchy/Regency Enterprises and granted an option on the rest of its holding.</p>
<p>In addition the agreement gives Proventus an option to acquire shares in Monarchy/Regency.</p>
</text>
